uplink-cascade-bomb-name = Cascade Bomb
uplink-cascade-bomb-desc = A new prototype explosive that's capable of producing a atom-sized resonance cascade. Releases extreme amounts of energy and violently absorbs body heat.

uplink-flash-grenade-name = Flash Grenade
uplink-flash-grenade-desc = A standard-issue flashbang, capable of blinding and slowing down anyone without proper protection. This, of course, includes you; make sure you're properly equipped before using it.

uplink-whitehole-grenade-name = Whitehole Grenade
uplink-whitehole-grenade-desc = A grenade that repulses everything around for about 10 seconds. Very useful on Trieste Port specifically.
